<view class="preferences-page">
  <view class="page-heading"><text class="page-title">提醒设置</text><text class="page-description">选择需要跟进的事项。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error"><text>{{error}}</text><button wx:if="{{!ready && !loading}}" class="text-button" bindtap="load">重试</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取设置…</view>
  <block wx:elif="{{ready}}">
    <view class="settings-group">
      <label class="setting-row"><view class="setting-copy"><text class="setting-title">匹配到新活动</text><text class="setting-description">按卡包中的银行与卡片条件匹配新活动</text></view><switch checked="{{newActivities}}" color="#165dcc" data-field="newActivities" bindchange="change" disabled="{{saving}}" aria-label="匹配到新活动提醒" /></label>
      <label class="setting-row"><view class="setting-copy"><text class="setting-title">活动即将截止</text><text class="setting-description">跟进已加入但本期尚未完成的活动</text></view><switch checked="{{deadlines}}" color="#165dcc" data-field="deadlines" bindchange="change" disabled="{{saving}}" aria-label="活动即将截止提醒" /></label>
      <label class="setting-row"><view class="setting-copy"><text class="setting-title">奖励待到账</text><text class="setting-description">按你填写的预计到账日提醒确认</text></view><switch checked="{{rewards}}" color="#165dcc" data-field="rewards" bindchange="change" disabled="{{saving}}" aria-label="奖励待到账提醒" /></label>
      <label class="setting-row"><view class="setting-copy"><text class="setting-title">信用卡还款</text><text class="setting-description">按卡包中保存的还款日期跟进</text></view><switch checked="{{repayments}}" color="#165dcc" data-field="repayments" bindchange="change" disabled="{{saving}}" aria-label="信用卡还款提醒" /></label>
    </view>
    <view class="note"><text class="note-title">微信消息需要单独开启</text><text class="note-copy">设置偏好后，可在活动列表开启下一次新活动提醒，或在具体活动、账单中开启本次提醒，并同意微信订阅消息。关闭某类提醒后，该类微信消息将不再发送，已有待办记录仍会保留。</text><text class="note-copy">还款日期以银行账单为准，提醒不能代替银行通知。</text></view>
    <text wx:if="{{saved}}" class="saved-message">提醒设置已保存</text>
    <button class="primary-button" bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || !dirty}}">{{saving ? '正在保存' : '保存设置'}}</button>
  </block>
</view>
